From: Justsomebuddy <justsomebuddy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 12:47:15 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix(network): retry unresolved explicit lookups after
 convergence

Use the existing router maintenance cycle for at most two retries per locally admitted explicit lookup. Preserve throttle, expiry, signed-notification validation, best-effort buffering and wire/crypto behavior. Add fresh-peer public API regression and bounded lifecycle controls.
